<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VIGNESH G | DARK ARCHITECT</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #050508;
            --card-bg: rgba(13, 13, 20, 0.85); /* Semi-transparent for video background */
            --accent-red: #ff003c;
            --accent-purple: #9d00ff;
            --text-color: #e0e0e0;
            --text-dim: #a0a0b0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Background Video & Image Styling */
        .bg-video-container {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: -2;
            overflow: hidden;
            /* Optional Background Image (video load aagala-na idhu theryum) */
            background: url('your-background-image.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
        }

        .bg-video-container video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            filter: brightness(0.4) contrast(1.2); /* Darken video for better text readability */
        }

        /* Overlay mask for extra evil dark effect */
        .bg-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.6);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Ambient Evil Glow Effects */
        .glow-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: -20%;
            left: -10%;
            width: 50vw;
            height: 50vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .glow-bg-2 {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -20%;
            right: -10%;
            width: 50vw;
            height: 50vw;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        header {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.2);
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--accent-red);
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-red);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .role-badges {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .badge {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-red);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--accent-red);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: #fff;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-red);
            padding-left: 1rem;
        }

        /* Grid Layout */
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 1.8rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .skill-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-color);
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .tag.highlight {
            border-color: var(--accent-purple);
            color: #d18aff;
        }

        /* Bio Section */
        .bio-box {
            background: rgba(13, 13, 20, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.8);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Background Video and Overlay -->
    <div class="bg-video-container">
        <!-- Video link-a inge replace pannungal (.mp4 file link) -->
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
            <source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-cyber-city-street-at-night-41225-large.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-overlay"></div>

    <div class="glow-bg"></div>
    <div class="glow-bg-2"></div>

    <header>
        <div class="tagline">// SYSTEM ARCHITECT & CREATIVE ENGINEER</div>
        <h1>VIGNESH G</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">B.E. Computer Science & Engineering Student</p>
        
        <div class="role-badges">
            <span class="badge">WEB DEVELOPER</span>
            <span class="badge">APP DEVELOPER</span>
            <span class="badge">VIDEO EDITOR</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="about">
        <h2 class="section-title">SYSTEM OVERVIEW</h2>
        <div class="bio-box">
            <p>I am a B.E. CSE student operating at the intersection of application development, web architecture, software engineering, and high-impact digital media editing. I design functional applications and craft visually intense audio-visual experiences.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
        <h2 class="section-title">CORE SKILLS & TECH STACK</h2>
        <div class="skills-grid">
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>💻 Programming Languages</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag">Java</span>
                    <span class="tag">Python</span>
                    <span class="tag">C</span>
                    <span class="tag">C++</span>
                    <span class="tag">HTML</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🎮 Game & App Development</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag highlight">Godot Engine</span>
                    <span class="tag highlight">GDevelop</span>
                    <span class="tag">Mobile Web Apps</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🎬 Video & FX Editing</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag">CapCut</span>
                    <span class="tag">Alight Motion</span>
                    <span class="tag">Motion Graphics</span>
                    <span class="tag">VFX Pipeline</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🤖 AI & Workflow Tools</h3>
                <div class="skill-tags">
                    <span class="tag highlight">ChatGPT</span>
                    <span class="tag highlight">Gemini AI</span>
                     <span class="tag highlight">replit AI</span>
                     <span class="tag highlight">GitHub</span>
                    <span class="tag">Prompt Engineering</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; VIGNESH G. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
